koi to lasha e shabbir laye qaimo mein<br>
behen ghareeb ki turbat banaye qaimo mein<br>
<br>
1. jo mashk khali liye atay shah ko dekha<br>
yun pas rakha hai ibn e ali ki ghurbat ka<br>
sagheer bacho ne kosay chupaye khaimo mein<br>
<br>
2. mein apne hath se turbat bana ke aya hu<br>
rabab dasht mein asghar sula ke aya hu<br>
hussain kaise ye ja ker bataye khaimo me<br>
<br>
3. ye jaltay qaimo ka manzar ajeeb hai ya rabb<br>
utha ke jati hai abid ko is tarha zainab<br>
hussain jis tarha akbar ko lae qaimo mein<br>
<br>
4. kafan ki aakhri umeed akhri tatbeer<br>
aabhi toh sar pe salamath hai chadar e tatheer<br>
<br>
5. guroob hota hai suraj tuloo hotay hai sab<br>
tadap rahi hai har ek maa ye dekh kar akbar<br>
ke badgte aatay naizo ke saae qaimo mein